msgstr "提交 link:https://reviews.freebsd.org/[Phabricator 评审]，并将 _status_ 组添加到评审者列表中。请将报告放在 `doc/website/content/en/status/` 下适当的子目录中（如果目录不存在，请创建）；"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-status-report-process/_index.adoc:123
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"submit a pull request to the doc repository through link:https://github.com/"
"freebsd/freebsd-doc[its GitHub mirror] .  You should put your reports in the "
"appropriate subdirectory of `doc/website/content/en/status` (create it if it "
"is missing);"
msgstr "通过 link:https://github.com/freebsd/freebsd-doc[其 GitHub 镜像]向 doc 仓库提交拉取请求。请将报告放在 `doc/website/content/en/status` 下适当的子目录中（如果目录不存在，请创建）；"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-status-report-process/_index.adoc:125
#, fuzzy
msgid "send an email to status-submissions@FreeBSD.org including your report."
msgstr "发送电子邮件至 status-submissions@FreeBSD.org，并附上你的报告。"

#. type: Plain text
#: documentation/content/en/articles/freebsd-status-report-process/_index.adoc:127
#, fuzzy
